        page["route"] = "/doc/api/dvalue-to-json/"
        page["title"] = "DValue to_json"
        page["content"] = "`DValue::to_json()` is a C++ API. It escapes and quotes strings. It writes numbers as runtime numeric text. It writes booleans as `true` or `false`. Maps return `(array)`.\n\nC++ represents pointers as `(pointer)` and references as `(reference)`. Capy does not expose `dval_to_json`. Use `json_encode(value)` for JSON.\n"
