        page["title"] = "DValue to_stringmap"
        page["content"] = "`DValue::to_stringmap()` is a C++ API. It converts map children to string entries. A nonempty string, f64, or boolean becomes a `value` entry. An empty string returns an empty map.\n\nIt also converts C++ pointers. It returns an empty map for an unresolved reference. Capy does not expose `dval_to_stringmap`. Use a `dval` map directly.\n"
        page["returns"] = "C++ `StringMap` copy"
